{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"flula-borg","name":"Flula Borg","birthDate":"1982-03-28","birthPlace":"Erlangen, Bavaria, West Germany [now Germany]","bio":"Flula Borg (born March 28, 1982) is a German techno DJ, engineer, actor, and YouTube personality who is better known as DJ Flula or simply Flula. He currently lives and works in Los Angeles, California. Borg appeared in the film Pitch Perfect 2 (2015) as a part of the German a cappella group Das Sound Machine.\n\nBorg co-starred in Pitch Perfect 2 (2015), as the leader of a German a cappella group competing against the Bellas in an international competition. He also appeared in WWE Films' Killing Hasselhoff, which featured such actors as Ken Jeong, Hulk Hogan, and David Hasselhoff.\n\nFlula regularly posts videos on YouTube and his channel has amassed over 600,000 subscribers and 70 million total views since its launch in 2007. Some of his most popular videos are his vlogs, most notably \"Jennifer is a Party Pooper\", and his AutoTunes series, in which he records cover songs live in his car. His AutoTunes video with YouTube celebrity Chester See, a cover of \"No Diggity\" by Blackstreet, has over three million views and was nominated for a Streamy Award in 2014 Also in 2014, Flula's YouTube channel was listed on New Media Rockstars Top 100 Channels, ranked at #69.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T18:01:04+00:00","tmdbId":1471841,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1471841","credits":[{"id":"guardians-holiday","title":"Guardians of the Galaxy Holiday Special","character":"Bartender","characterFa":"متصدی بار"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/flula-borg.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Crawl 2","year":2027,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ty5k62rPk4lu55uL44K9XhdPitJ.jpg"},{"name":"LEGO Star Wars: The Mandalorian","year":2026,"character":"The Client (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/x3HEvYXWOW6WHqsHmg2MUVy3SLm.jpg"},{"